ck him down through Everwood\u2014a dreamlike world teeming with mystery, danger, and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596370/extras/Bear_Attack_500.gif?t=1746119662\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Escape Evil\u2019s Clutches, Save the Wilderness</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The animals have been kidnapped, transformed into stuffed toys, and trapped in claw machines. Can you outsmart their captor and bring them home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596370/extras/Pet_10s_500.gif?t=1746119662\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solve Puzzles &amp; Outsmart the Wicked Dr. Kidd</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crack tricky puzzles to sneak into Dr. Kidd\u2019s secret labs and foil his dark experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596370/extras/Puzzle_Bear_500.gif?t=1746119662\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master the Claw in VR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of a high-tech drone claw to rescue animals trapped in claw machines.Precision and skill are your only way to set them free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596370/extras/Claw_500.gif?t=1746119662\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Escape in Platforming Challenges</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guide rescued animals to safety through platforming levels with branching paths, dangerous obstacles, and sneaky dodging traps while collecting rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596370/extras/Challenge_500.gif?t=1746119662\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Restore Nature</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every rescued animal helps bring Everwood back to life, turning barren wilderness into a vibrant ecosystem full of wonder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596370/extras/SmashThornsToRescue_500.gif?t=1746119662\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to claw your way to freedom?</p>","developers":["Time Traveller"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596370/257da859f61c9cf3adc88a531875e24d893235ed/header.jpg?t=1746119662","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257133162,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133162/movie480.mp4?t=1746118817","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133162/movie_max.mp4?t=1746118817"},"name":"Bearly Escape - Early Access Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257133162/7433296e0dcfa9a12a66e51b4e028bba494a1111/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746118817","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133162/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746118817","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133162/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746118817"}}],"name":"Bearly Escape","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_fre